      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-center relative">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-sky-600 text-white font-black text-sm flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-md">
          2
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Define Logistics</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Specify target shelf-life days, ambient vs. refrigerated temperature, and packaging format (pouch, tray, etc.).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-center relative">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-sky-600 text-white font-black text-sm flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-md">
          3
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Compute Recommendation</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          AI computes optimal polymer structure, film gauge, MAP gas ratio, and multi-attribute trade-off matrix.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-center relative">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 text-white font-black text-sm flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-md">
          4
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Export &amp; Implement</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Inspect interactive charts, read "Why is this material best?" theory, and download ISO-compliant PDF datasheets.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

